---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
const guide = {
  "title": "Canada Visitor Visa from Pakistan: Evidence, Fees & Steps",
  "description": "Prepare a Canadian visitor application with IRCC’s checklist, separate fee and biometrics costs, and the current processing service.",
  "intro": "Prepare a Canadian visitor application with IRCC’s checklist, separate fee and biometrics costs, and the current processing service.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "IRCC visitor application guide",
      "url": "https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/visit-canada/apply-visitor-visa.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "IRCC fee list",
      "url": "https://ircc.canada.ca/english/information/fees/fees.asp"
    },
    {
      "title": "IRCC processing checker",
      "url": "https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/application/check-processing-times.html"
    },
    {
      "title": "IRCC visit options",
      "url": "https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/visit-canada.html"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Use the correct application route",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Begin with IRCC’s visitor questions and the route they provide for your circumstances. Do not assume everyone uses identical forms or a single portal. A parent/grandparent super visa has a separate eligibility and insurance checklist; do not substitute an ordinary visitor checklist."
      ],
      "source": 3
    },
    {
      "heading": "Explain the visit clearly",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Organise purpose, dates, accommodation, payer and expected cost. Explain sponsorship and relevant employment, business, study or family circumstances. Follow the generated document list rather than a fixed list copied from another applicant.",
        "Create a document index linking each item to the requirement it answers. Check names, passport numbers, dates and financial evidence together. Extra paper is useful only if it explains a relevant part of the application."
      ],
      "source": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Budget for the correct currency",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The published visitor fee, including super visas, is CAD 100 per person. Biometrics may be separate; exemptions and family caps depend on the case. Confirm the amount in IRCC’s payment service. A market-rate PKR conversion is not an official payment quote."
      ],
      "source": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Follow requests and current timing",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Read your own biometric, document or passport request and its deadline. Use the live time checker with the correct application category and country. The previous four-to-eight-week estimate is not a reliable promise for new applications."
      ],
      "source": 2
    },
    {
      "heading": "Read the permission actually issued",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Do not assume a ten-year multiple-entry visa or six-month stay is guaranteed. Visa validity and the authorised period at entry are different. If plans change or a refusal arrives, use IRCC’s instructions for the case rather than copying another country’s appeal or extension rules."
      ],
      "source": 3
    }
  ]
};
---
<GuideLayout {...guide} />
